because they're reacting more to me

730
00:51:46,686 --> 00:51:47,521
than to you.

731
00:51:49,147 --> 00:51:52,317
It seems to me, that we have no one
but each other to count on.

732
00:51:54,861 --> 00:51:55,695
N

733
